Right now, ~claude/.claude/ is on the jail root dataset and is destroyed
with a `just clean`. I want the claude dir to persist across jail setup.

Update lab-claude jail.conf to mount /jails/data/lab-claude/dot-claude/
to ~claude/.claude/.

There's an additional question of the ~claude/.claude.json file. We can
do the same mechanism, mounting /jails/data/lab-claude/dot-claude.json
into place. However I think it would be more useful if we could store
the config in a dir and just mount that, and set the config file with an
env var.

Research the .claude.json file, see if it can be moved elsewhere, and if
there are any issues with including it in .claude/ itself.
